<h2 id="milestone">1. The Historic Milestone for Assam</h2>
<p>Until today, translation between English and Assamese on commercial cloud systems (such as Google Translate or Microsoft Bing Translator) was plagued by comical inaccuracies and broken syntax. Because Assamese is an agglutinative language where grammatical relationships are expressed via complex postpositions (বিভক্তি: -ৰ, -লৈ, -ত, -দ্বাৰা, -ক), generic models frequently drop case endings, invert active and passive clauses, and produce literal, nonsensical translations of legal and administrative records.</p>
<p>Moreover, transmitting sensitive government gazettes, court filings, and educational materials across foreign commercial APIs creates significant data sovereignty vulnerabilities. <strong>Axom AI Bridge &mdash; Xetu (সেতু)</strong> provides the native solution: a <strong>200 Million parameter sequence-to-sequence neural translation bridge</strong> specifically tuned on parallel corpora spanning governance, legal statutes, agricultural extension, and academic curricula.</p>

<h2 id="built">2. What Axom AI Built</h2>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card ic">
    <span class="ic-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 8 6 6"/><path d="m4 14 6-6 2-3"/><path d="M2 5h12"/><path d="M7 2h1"/><path d="m22 22-5-10-5 10"/><path d="M14 18h6"/></svg></span>
    <h3>Flawless Morphological Case Marking</h3>
    <p>Engineered to preserve Assamese case endings (-ৰ, -লৈ, -ত, -দ্বাৰা), ensuring that complex multi-clause sentences maintain exact legal and grammatical relationships.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card ic">
    <span class="ic-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg></span>
    <h3>Administrative &amp; Legal Rigor</h3>
    <p>Calibrated directly on official state government notifications, revenue guidelines, and court proceedings, preventing mistranslations of critical terminology.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card ic">
    <span class="ic-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span>
    <h3>100% Air-Gapped Data Sovereignty</h3>
    <p>Runs completely offline and on-premise, ensuring confidential legal documents and state government files never leave Assam's physical boundaries.</p>
