<tr><td><strong>Idioms &amp; Proverbs</strong></td><td>❌ Literal word-for-word nonsense</td><td>❌ Untranslated English loanwords</td><td>🌾 <strong>Native Assamese idiomatic fluency</strong></td></tr>
